    "B": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\tan x-1}{\\sqrt{2\\tan x}}\\right)-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{\\tan x-\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}{\\tan x+\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}\\right|+C$",
    "C": "$\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt2}\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\tan x-1}{\\sqrt{2\\tan x}}\\right)+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\ln\\left|\\frac{\\tan x-\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}{\\tan x+\\sqrt{2\\tan x}+1}\\right|+C$",
